[en.TECHNOLOGY_ANCIENT_MELEE_WEAPON]
Ancient Melee Weapon

[en.TECHNOLOGY_ANCIENT_MELEE_WEAPON_desc]
Wooden Melee:
A high-tech wooden machine for breaking skulls, the Wooden Melee is a fearsome weapon designed for those who prefer a more... rustic approach to combat. Crafted from the finest timber, it combines the elegance of nature with the brutality of war. Whether you’re bucking enemies in the trenches or galloping through the battlefield, this trusty wooden weapon will leave your foes bafflingly bonked, literally. Just be careful not to accidentally start a campfire during heated engagements!
§g“...in conclusion, a high-tech wooden machine for breaking skulls.”§!

Steel Melee:
With its razor-sharp edges and solid heft, the Steel Melee will slice through enemy lines like a hot knife through... well, you get the idea. Just remember to polish it regularly to maintain that dazzling shine, because a dull blade is about as useful as a bureaucrat at a revolution.
§g“You can use them to cut more than just butter, but butter is fine too, and you don’t necessarily have to heat them up.”§!

Heavy Steel Armor:
In a world where friendship is magic, sometimes you need a little extra protection to keep you not overwhelmed by the enthusiasm of your enemies: you need reinforcements. Recinforcements of what? Reinforcements of goodwill of course! ...what? You say that 800 fully-armored soliders is an awful lot? No, it is just an awful lot of goodwill.
§g“A solid backing shield of friendship, literally.”§!

[zh.TECHNOLOGY_ANCIENT_MELEE_WEAPON]
古代近战武器

[zh.TECHNOLOGY_ANCIENT_MELEE_WEAPON_desc]
木制近战武器：
木制近战武器是一种用于打破头骨的高科技木制机器，它是专为那些喜欢...更质朴的战斗方式的小马所设计的可怕武器。它由最优质的木材制成，将自然的优雅与战争的残酷融为一体。无论您是在战壕中与地方搏斗，还是在战场上驰骋，这款值得信赖的木制武器都可以让您的地方摸不着头脑（物理）。只是要小心，不要在激烈交战中不小心点燃篝火！
§g“...总而言之，一种用于打破头骨的高科技木制机器。”§!

铁制近战武器：
凭借锋利的边缘和坚固的重量，带着铁制近战武器冲锋切断地方的防线会轻松得像是一把加热的刀切开...额，你懂的。只不过要记得定期擦亮它以保持耀眼的光泽，因为钝化的钢刀就像革命中的官僚一样没用。
§g“你可以用它们可以切开不止是黄油的东西，但是黄油也是可以的，也并不一定非要加热。”§!

铁制重装盾甲：
在这个友谊就是魔力的世界里，有时你需要一点额外的保护，才能不被地方的热情所淹没：你需要巩固。巩固什么？当然是巩固的善意...什么？你说 800 名全副武装的士兵有点太多了？不，这只是因为我们的善意太多了。
§g“友谊的坚实后盾，字面意义。”§!
